      ['No-Gi · Grappling', 'Takedowns, controls and submissions without strikes in a dynamic no-gi format.'],
      ['Private classes', 'Sessions for one or two people, with schedule and content adapted to their needs.'],
      ['Open Mat', 'Open training on Saturdays from 14:00 to 15:00.'],
    ],
    startTitle: 'How to start',
    startCopy: 'Simply message us and come along for a free trial class. We will tell you when to come and what to bring.',
    startSteps: [
      ['Message us on WhatsApp', 'Tell us you would like to try a class. Booking is not required, but we recommend letting us know before coming.'],
      ['Come and try it', 'Bring comfortable clothes, flip-flops and good hygiene. The trial class is free and comes with no commitment.'],
